  npcName: Recluse
  lines:
  - text: "That house across the river\u2026 It wasn\u2019t there yesterday. I\u2019ve
      studied this land for years."
    choices:
    - choiceText: "Why\u2019s that odd?"
      nextLineIndex: 1
    - choiceText: Leave.
      nextLineIndex: 2
  - text: "It\u2019s not just a house. The structure shifts when you're not looking.
      I saw it. I don't recommend go near the house."
    choices: []
  - text: Bye
    choices: []
